{"id":"923d94bd12fb8dd3","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map.md","title":"ZFC Model Collapse Map","display":"df-zfc-model-collapse-map — ZFC Model Collapse Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map","58-df-zfc-model8-collapse-map","58-df-zfc-model9-collapse-map","58-df-zfc-ordinal2-collapse-map"],"display":"df-zfc-model-collapse-map — ZFC Model Collapse Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-collapse-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-model8-collapse-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-model9-collapse-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal2-collapse-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-collapse-map — ZFC Model Collapse Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,M,N,x,y\\in V\">\\(\\pi,M,N,x,y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel8CollapseMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel9CollapseMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2CollapseMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel8CollapseMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel9CollapseMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2CollapseMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,M,N)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)=N\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;(x\\subseteq N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,M,N)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi)=N\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;(x\\subseteq N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8CollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8CollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9CollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9CollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2CollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2CollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModelCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>Bijectivity is explicit, so the membership-preserving map is an isomorphism onto the transitive image <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-model8-collapse-map</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-model9-collapse-map</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-ordinal2-collapse-map</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"r